        <mxCell id="step2-2" value="2. Check Tools&#xa;&#xa;For each step:&#xa;• Check if tool installed&#xa;• If not: install on-demand&#xa;• Wait for installation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
